---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="About RDR & Associates | Purpose-Driven Accounting Firm"
  description="We are a women-led accounting firm committed to creating opportunities. Learn about our mission to empower women and differently-abled individuals while delivering exceptional financial services."
>
  <section class="relative pt-48 pb-24 overflow-hidden bg-white">
    <div class="opacity-[0.03] z-0 absolute top-0 right-0 bottom-0 left-0"></div>

    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-[600px] z-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden opacity-30">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 1440 600" preserveAspectRatio="none" class="w-full h-full absolute bottom-0 left-0 scale-x-100 scale-y-75 origin-bottom">
        <path fill="url(#header-swoosh-gradient)" d="M-100,500 C400,450 600,100 1600,200 L1600,205 C600,105 400,455 -100,505 Z"></path>
      </svg>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-8 relative z-10">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-20 items-start">
        <div class="relative translate-y-16">
          <span class="inline-block uppercase text-xs font-semibold text-[#3305d8] tracking-widest bg-[#3305d8]/5 border-[#3305d8]/20 border rounded-none mb-8 pt-1.5 pr-4 pb-1.5 pl-4">
            Our Story
          </span>
          <div class="intro-headline leading-[1] md:text-7xl text-6xl font-medium text-slate-900 tracking-tight font-serif mb-8">
            <p><em>Purpose oriented</em><br /> finance.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col justify-center h-full pt-4">
          <div class="leading-relaxed text-2xl font-light text-[#676769] font-inter mb-10">
            <p>
              We are an accounting firm established with a clear and purposeful vision - to create meaningful opportunities and deliver lasting value for our clients.
            </p>
            <p>
              Our mission extends beyond the ledger. We exist to give job opportunities to <strong>women and differently abled kids</strong> so that they can build their self-esteem and lead a purposeful life.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-[#3305d8] border-[#3305d8]/10 border rounded-2xl pt-8 pr-8 pb-8 pl-8 relative overflow-hidden group">
            <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-8 opacity-10 group-hover:opacity-20 transition-opacity">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="64" height="64" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-heart text-white">
                <path d="M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xl italic text-neutral-50 font-inter relative z-10">
              Beyond professional excellence, we believe in giving back to the community through initiatives focused on education and inclusion.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-y bg-slate-50 border-[#676769]/10 pt-24 pb-24 relative">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-8">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="overflow-hidden shadow-[#3305d8]/5 group hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-[#3305d8]/5 transition-all duration-300 bg-white border-[#3305d8]/30 border rounded-3xl pt-10 pr-10 pb-10 pl-10 relative">
          <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-8 opacity-20 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="64" height="64" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-target text-[#3305d8]">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle>
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl text-[#3305d8] mb-6">Our Mission</h3>
          <div class="leading-relaxed text-lg font-light text-stone-700 font-inter">
            <p>
              To provide exceptional accounting and taxation services while maintaining the highest level of integrity and professionalism. We strive to meet the current and future needs of our clients, helping them achieve long-term success while establishing trust and loyalty between employees, partners, and clients.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="shadow-[#3305d8]/5 overflow-hidden group hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-[#3305d8]/5 transition-all duration-300 bg-white border-[#3305d8]/30 border rounded-3xl pt-10 pr-10 pb-10 pl-10 relative">
          <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-8 opacity-20 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="64" height="64" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-eye text-[#3305d8]">
              <path d="M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0"></path>
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl text-[#3305d8] mb-6">Our Vision</h3>
          <div class="leading-relaxed text-lg font-light text-stone-700 font-inter">
            <p>
              To be recognized regionally as the <strong>women-led accounting firm of choice</strong>. We aim to provide comprehensive services while fostering an environment where <strong>women and differently abled employees</strong> can grow to their fullest potential and lead purposeful lives.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="shadow-[#3305d8]/5 overflow-hidden group hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-[#3305d8]/5 transition-all duration-300 bg-white border-[#3305d8]/30 border rounded-3xl pt-10 pr-10 pb-10 pl-10 relative">
          <div class="opacity-20 pt-8 pr-8 pb-8 pl-8 absolute top-0 right-0 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="64" height="64" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles text-[#3305d8]">
              <path d="m12 3-1.912 5.813a2 2 0 0 1-1.275 1.275L3 12l5.813 1.912a2 2 0 0 1 1.275 1.275L12 21l1.912-5.813a2 2 0 0 1 1.275-1.275L21 12l-5.813-1.912a2 2 0 0 1-1.275-1.275Z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl text-[#3305d8] mb-6">Our Values</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-4 text-lg text-[#676769] font-light leading-relaxed list-disc ml-5 marker:text-[#3305d8]">
            <li class="text-stone-700 font-inter pl-1">Honesty, integrity and ethics in all we do.</li>
            <li class="text-stone-700 font-inter pl-1">Empower and employ talented, caring and responsible people.</li>
            <li class="text-stone-700 font-inter pl-1">Provide an enjoyable work environment and give back to the communities we serve.</li>
            <li class="text-stone-700 font-inter pl-1">Maintain constant communication with the clients and always respond in a prompt and professional manner.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-32 bg-white relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute right-0 top-40 translate-x-1/3 opacity-20 pointer-events-none -z-10 w-[800px] animate-float">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 1440 300" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-full h-full">
        <path d="M-100 200 C 400 250 800 50 1540 150" stroke="url(#sw-gradient)" stroke-width="3" fill="none"></path>
      </svg>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-7xl mr-auto ml-auto pr-8 pl-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-24">
        <span class="uppercase text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest text-[#3305d8]">The Leadership</span>
        <h2 class="text-5xl text-slate-900 tracking-tight font-serif mt-6">Our Team</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-16 mb-32">
        <div class="lg:w-1/3 flex justify-center lg:justify-end">
          <div class="relative group">
            <div class="w-64 h-64 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border border-[#676769]/10 flex items-center justify-center relative z-10 overflow-hidden group-hover:border-[#3305d8]/30 transition-colors duration-500">
              <span class="font-serif text-6xl text-[#3305d8]/20 group-hover:text-[#3305d8] transition-colors duration-500">RD</span>
            </div>
            <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full border border-[#3305d8]/20 scale-110 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:scale-125 transition-all duration-700"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="lg:w-2/3">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-center lg:text-left mb-8">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-4xl text-slate-900">Ranjitha Dinesh</h3>
            <span class="uppercase text-sm font-semibold text-[#3305d8] tracking-widest">Managing Partner</span>
          </div>

          <div class="text-[#676769] font-light text-xl leading-relaxed text-justify lg:text-left">
            <p>
              Ranjitha Dinesh is the founder and managing partner of R D R, A result-oriented professional with a dynamic career of over 28 years driving management strategy and aligning the financial functions with business goals of organization, a firm involved in providing one stop solutions to their clients in the areas accounting, taxation, compliance, payroll and consulting services.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row-reverse items-start gap-16">
        <div class="lg:w-1/3 flex justify-center lg:justify-start">
          <div class="relative group sticky top-40">
            <div class="w-64 h-64 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border border-[#676769]/10 flex items-center justify-center relative z-10 overflow-hidden group-hover:border-[#3305d8]/30 transition-colors duration-500">
              <span class="font-serif text-6xl text-[#3305d8]/20 group-hover:text-[#3305d8] transition-colors duration-500">DM</span>
            </div>
            <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full border border-[#3305d8]/20 scale-110 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:scale-125 transition-all duration-700"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="lg:w-2/3">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 lg:text-left text-center mb-8">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-4xl text-slate-900">Dinesh Mallan</h3>
            <span class="uppercase text-sm font-semibold text-[#3305d8] tracking-widest">Senior Partner</span>
          </div>

          <div class="text-[#676769] font-light text-xl leading-relaxed text-justify lg:text-left">
            <p>
              Dinesh Mallan is heading the risk management matters and consulting services in RDR. He has over 35 years of experience in the field of professional services. Before moving to India, Dinesh was the deputy managing partner in Grant Thornton, Botswana.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>

